Are you dizzying my bridge, Mr. Beat?

2980
03:11:33,530 --> 03:11:33,970
Huh?

2981
03:11:36,010 --> 03:11:39,470
I wasn't expecting you to get the craziest helmet I've ever seen today, Oliver.

2982
03:11:39,790 --> 03:11:41,370
Yeah, that's just me, you know?

2983
03:11:42,270 --> 03:11:43,710
I'm random like that.

2984
03:11:47,750 --> 03:11:49,550
Minecraft always makes for a happy Monday.

2985
03:11:49,810 --> 03:11:50,250
Yeah.

2986
03:11:51,890 --> 03:11:52,970
I couldn't agree more.

2987
03:11:55,710 --> 03:11:56,610
Thank you for the stream.

2988
03:11:56,730 --> 03:11:57,530
Thank you for showing up.

2989
03:11:58,850 --> 03:12:00,710
There's so many new chatters as well.

2990
03:12:00,930 --> 03:12:01,370
Snowin!

2991
03:12:01,530 --> 03:12:02,850
Your streams are always a joy to watch.

2992
03:12:02,990 --> 03:12:03,330
Thank you.

2993
03:12:04,310 --> 03:12:05,790
Hi, what's up, Vaxing Parsley?

2994
03:12:06,230 --> 03:12:07,590
No, Vaxing Parsley.

2995
03:12:09,150 --> 03:12:13,970
That actually makes me think of roast pork with parsley sauce now.

2996
03:12:14,730 --> 03:12:17,090
The national dish in Denmark, unofficially.

2997
03:12:18,990 --> 03:12:19,990
Pirate Meerkat.

2998
03:12:20,190 --> 03:12:22,370
Just binged a cut of your OG playthrough and loved it.

2999
03:12:22,470 --> 03:12:22,770
Nice!

3000
03:12:23,330 --> 03:12:23,970
Elis, right?

3001
03:12:24,950 --> 03:12:26,970
That one has gotten so popular.

3002
03:12:28,490 --> 03:12:30,570
So many new people coming in from that one.

3003
03:12:35,000 --> 03:12:37,680
There was an alarming number of cracks in bridge support.

3004
03:12:38,060 --> 03:12:39,780
I don't think it would pass inspection.

3005
03:12:40,860 --> 03:12:41,600
Here's the thing.

3006
03:12:41,800 --> 03:12:43,280
They're not real cracks, okay?

3007
03:12:43,440 --> 03:12:49,100
Someone went up there with a little, you know, a brush and painted those cracks on there.

3008
03:12:49,180 --> 03:12:50,040
It's just visual.

3009
03:12:50,600 --> 03:12:51,860
No need for concern.

3010
03:12:52,700 --> 03:12:58,060
Everything is tip-top solid and very supported.

3011
03:12:58,300 --> 03:12:58,580
Don't worry.

3012
03:13:00,640 --> 03:13:02,340
There's more people because it's spring break.

3013
03:13:03,660 --> 03:13:04,360
Spring break.

3014
03:13:06,100 --> 03:13:06,740
It is?

3015
03:13:08,960 --> 03:13:10,920
I guess that's an American thing.

3016
03:13:12,840 --> 03:13:15,760
Well, I guess it's also a Danish thing, but I just don't know when that is, usually.

3017
03:13:16,940 --> 03:13:18,440
Any spring breakers in here?

3018
03:13:19,400 --> 03:13:21,200
Isn't that usually high school stuff, though?

3019
03:13:21,280 --> 03:13:22,000
How old are you guys?

3020
03:13:23,800 --> 03:13:24,360
Hold on.

3021
03:13:24,580 --> 03:13:25,940
I kind of want to make a poll here.

3022
03:13:27,080 --> 03:13:27,820
Really quickly.

3023
03:13:30,380 --> 03:13:31,100
How old?

3024
03:13:32,190 --> 03:13:33,570
Let's see here.

3025
03:13:34,310 --> 03:13:35,450
Less than 20.

3026
03:13:35,890 --> 03:13:37,170
20 to 30.

3027
03:13:37,730 --> 03:13:38,810
30 plus.

3028
03:13:40,650 --> 03:13:42,090
50 plus.

3029
03:13:42,670 --> 03:13:45,630
I guess 30... 50.

3030
03:13:50,050 --> 03:13:51,170
Go.

3031
03:13:53,090 --> 03:13:54,550
There's a poll!

3032
03:14:05,840 --> 03:14:07,700
Two people over 50!

3033
03:14:07,880 --> 03:14:08,680
That's awesome!

3034
03:14:11,640 --> 03:14:13,700
And a lot of people between 30 and 50.

3035
03:14:13,900 --> 03:14:16,500
But I'm assuming most of those are maybe in their 30s.

3036
03:14:17,700 --> 03:14:21,280
But it definitely looks like a Gaussian distribution there.

3037
03:14:21,420 --> 03:14:24,260
A normal distribution around 25-ish.

3038
03:14:25,800 --> 03:14:27,140
Which makes sense, I guess.

3039
03:14:29,780 --> 03:14:34,660
Are there anyone less than 10 years old in here right now?

3040
03:14:35,620 --> 03:14:36,840
I doubt that.

3041
03:14:37,360 --> 03:14:38,460
And you can't lie.

3042
03:14:44,820 --> 03:14:45,860
If so, get out.

3043
03:14:46,040 --> 03:14:46,440
I agree.

3044
03:14:46,680 --> 03:14:50,560
This is not a children-friendly stream.

3045
03:14:51,200 --> 03:14:56,280
In fact, I think when you open my stream, there is a disclaimer that you have to be 18 to watch.

3046
03:14:57,480 --> 03:14:59,080
Yeah, mature content, exactly.

3047
03:15:02,310 --> 03:15:04,970
Twitch auto-bans you if you say your age is lower than 13.

3048
03:15:05,270 --> 03:15:06,350
Ooh, shit, okay.

3049
03:15:07,570 --> 03:15:08,570
I had no idea.

3050
03:15:09,130 --> 03:15:10,190
I'm an attack child.

3051
03:15:11,170 --> 03:15:12,610
Any attack children here?

3052
03:15:15,070 --> 03:15:18,530
So when the OnlyFans dropping, who says I don't already have one?

3053
03:15:21,590 --> 03:15:22,870
Mature, but childish.

3054
03:15:23,110 --> 03:15:23,590
Exactly.

3055
03:15:25,370 --> 03:15:28,050
Guys, I don't know what skibbity-toilet is.

3056
03:15:28,950 --> 03:15:30,590
I'm not young enough.

3057
03:15:30,770 --> 03:15:31,490
I don't get it.

3058
03:15:33,070 --> 03:15:34,870
I heard... I've been hearing it everywhere.

3059
03:15:38,570 --> 03:15:39,070
Lucky?

3060
03:15:40,390 --> 03:15:41,490
How old are you, though?

3061
03:15:41,650 --> 03:15:42,810
I'm... 33.

3062
03:15:43,790 --> 03:15:46,470
I'm pretty much smack dab in the middle of the poll.

3063
03:15:51,960 --> 03:15:54,220
I don't think anyone knows, even the people who say it.

3064
03:15:54,300 --> 03:15:55,340
Oh, it's not even a real thing?

3065
03:15:58,240 --> 03:15:59,200
I guess that makes sense.

3066
03:16:01,020 --> 03:16:02,780
I know who Hawk Tour Girl is, though.

3067
03:16:03,360 --> 03:16:05,240
But only because I watch Moist Critical.

3068
03:16:08,000 --> 03:16:09,500
And he covered that at some point.

3069
03:16:18,040 --> 03:16:20,480
Oliver, we should add that word to the word blacklist.

3070
03:16:20,600 --> 03:16:25,500
I don't think I have a word blacklist other than whatever Twitch has installed per default.

3071
03:16:27,700 --> 03:16:29,620
How brain-rotted do you think you are?

3072
03:16:30,300 --> 03:16:32,720
On a percentage scale or something?

3073
03:16:32,980 --> 03:16:38,280
I would say maybe... 20% of my brain is rotting right now.

3074
03:16:43,470 --> 03:16:44,170
Just got here.

3075
03:16:44,250 --> 03:16:44,990
What's with this screen?

3076
03:16:46,250 --> 03:16:49,090
Uh, it's just a waiting screen when nothing's happening.

3077
03:16:49,290 --> 03:16:50,930
I just ended the stream, pretty much.

3078
03:16:51,470 --> 03:16:52,650
I'm about to head out of here.

3079
03:16:53,090 --> 03:17:01,630
I'm an hour over schedule, so... Alright, guys, thank you so much for subbing and hanging out, and crazy amount of viewers today for some reason.

3080
03:17:02,150 --> 03:17:03,470
So, uh, cool.

3081
03:17:03,990 --> 03:17:04,690
I love it.

3082
03:17:05,190 --> 03:17:05,830
Thanks for watching.

3083
03:17:06,390 --> 03:17:07,310
I'll see you in the next stream.

3084
03:17:07,790 --> 03:17:08,350
Have a good one.

3085
03:17:09,350 --> 03:17:10,790
Good night, and enjoy your Monday!
